0	section	Delegation
0	section	Talking to Noah or Alina
1	line	Noah	So they're from the west?
1	line	Alina	Yes! They call it Varlamore, the Shining Kingdom! It's meant to be one of the most beautiful places in the world!
1	line	Player	What are you talking about?
1	cond	If the player is on a free-to-play world:
2	line	Alina	Oh, nothing you need to worry about.
2	action	members
1	cond	If the player is on a member's world:
2	line	Alina	Oh, hello! Are you here to see the delegation?
2	line	Player	Delegation?
2	line	Noah	See! It's not just me who doesn't know what's happening.
2	line	Alina	The delegation from Varlamore, of course! After all these years, they're finally opening up the kingdom for travel and trade! Isn't it exciting?
2	line	Noah	Why would I be excited about a place I never even knew existed?
2	line	Alina	A whole land locked off for hundreds of years! Do you not want to be one of the first outsiders to step foot there? Think of the adventure!
2	line	Noah	Adventure? Sounds dangerous. I'll be staying right here, thank you very much!
2	line	Alina	Bah! Boring! What about you, stranger?
2	select	Start the Children of the Sun quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Well I'm actually something of an adventurer myself.
3	line	Alina	That's the spirit! I bet you'll want to be one of the first to head over to Varlamore!
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	What can you tell me about Varlamore?
4	line	Player	What can you tell me about Varlamore?
4	line	Alina	It's far across the western sea, over the mountains south of Great Kourend. Between the sea and the mountains, it's totally isolated! No one is allowed to come or go without good reason.
4	line	Noah	Sounds like a prison.
4	line	Alina	Quite the opposite! It's a beautiful and prosperous kingdom, ruled over by the Sun Queen!
4	line	Player	The Sun Queen?
4	line	Alina	Yes! She rules from her palace in their capital, Civitas illa Fortis. The sun plays an important role in Varlamorian life. In fact, they worship it!
4	line	Noah	What... the sun?
4	line	Alina	That's right! They have their own religion over there dedicated to the sun and the moon. Isn't that fascinating?
4	line	Noah	I don't know... It all sounds a bit odd to me.
4	action	other
3	option	How come you know so much about Varlamore?
4	line	Player	How come you know so much about Varlamore?
4	line	Alina	A while back, a group of travellers came through here, on their way to the dark lands of Morytania. They said they were from the College of Bards!
4	line	Noah	College of Bards?
4	line	Alina	Yes! It's found in the floating city of Tempestus! Members of the College are some of the only people allowed to travel to and from Varlamore.
4	line	Alina	They stayed the night in the Blue Moon Inn and spent hours telling us all about their homeland. I've been dying to visit ever since!
4	action	other
3	option	When will this delegation arrive?
4	line	Player	When will this delegation arrive?
4	line	Alina	Well it should be any time now!
4	line	Noah	Hang on... what's going on over there?
4	line	Alina	Wait! That's them! They're here!
4	line	Alina	There they are: The children of the sun! That's Itzla Arkan, heir to the throne of Varlamore! And there's Servius, the Teokan of Ralos!
4	line	Noah	Teokan? What's a Teokan?
4	line	Alina	It means High Priest. He's the religious leader in Varlamore.
4	line	Noah	Huh...
4	line	Sergeant Tobyn	What are you doing with that bag?
4	line	Guard	Oh... Er... Just delivering some supplies to the guards at the gates.
4	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Well hurry back. We need everyone at their posts.
4	line	Noah	That's an unusually big bag he's carrying.
4	line	Player	Hmm... Now where might you be going with that...?
4	action	(Player begins tailing the guard.)
3	option	Sorry, but I need to head off.
4	line	Player	Sorry, but I need to head off.
4	line	Alina	Fair enough.
4	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	I'm not sure. Doesn't really sound like my kind of thing.
3	line	Alina	Well... suit yourself, I guess.
3	action	end
