0	section	Successfully following the "guard"
1	line	Player	What are you up to in there...?
1	line	Bandit (red hood)	You're late.
1	line	Guard	I'm here aren't I? If you're not happy, maybe you should have been the one to steal the uniforms!
1	line	Bandit (woman)	Enough! We don't have much time. Do you have everything?
1	line	Guard	Mostly.
1	line	Bandit (red hood)	Mostly?
1	line	Guard	I grabbed what I could!
1	line	Bandit (bearded)	We're just going to have to make do. The delegation is already in the palace. We need to be ready to strike as they leave.
1	line	Bandit (tanned)	Indeed. You all know the target. Get changed quick and be ready to take your positions.
1	line	Guard	Good luck. You're going to need it.
1	line	Bandit (bearded)	You lot panic too much. It's going to be fine. Now, let's get going.
1	line	Player	This doesn't sound good. I'd better let that sergeant know.
0	section	Talking to Sergeant Tobyn
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Move along, citizen.
1	line	Player	Wait! I have some information that you need to hear.
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	What is it?
1	line	Player	There are some bandits disguising themselves as guards! I think they're planning to attack the delegation from Varlamore!
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Surely you can't be serious?
1	line	Player	It's true! One of them infiltrated your guards and stole some uniforms. He came right through here earlier with them.
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	The one with the large bag? I thought I didn't recognise him, but then it's so hard to keep up. We get through guards so quickly around here for some reason...
1	line	Player	So what do we do? Should we warn the delegation?
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	And risk a panic? No. Better we deal with this now while they're safe in the palace. Do you know how many bandits there are?
1	line	Player	Four in total.
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Right, we can work with that. You get out there and point them out. With them being disguised, you'll need to keep a close eye out for any guard who looks or acts differently to the others.
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Don't go too far. If the bandits intend to attack the delegation, they'll either be here in the square or on the eastern road between the square and the bank.
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Return to me once you've found all four and we'll take them all at the same time.
1	line	Player	Alright, I'll get to it.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Sergeant Tobyn again
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Get out there and point out the four bandits. They're in disguise, so be sure to keep a close eye out for any guard who looks or acts differently to the others.
1	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Remember, if they intend to attack the delegation, they'll either be here in the square or on the eastern road between the square and the bank.
1	line	Player	Alright, I'll be back soon.
1	action	end
