2	action	end
1	cond	If the player correctly marked all four bandits:
2	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Good work. I'll signal my guards to bring them in...
2	box	Sergeant Tobyn signals to his guards and the bandits are quickly arrested.
2	line	Sergeant Tobyn	That could have ended up quite nasty if not for you. Once again, good work.
2	line	Player	So what happens now?
2	line	Sergeant Tobyn	The bandits will be interrogated. If all goes well, we'll get some useful information out of them.
2	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Speaking of which... given it was you who found them in the first place, you might be able to offer some support. Would you be willing to help?
2	line	Player	Of course! Where do you need me?
2	line	Sergeant Tobyn	Come with me. We'll use the cell on the palace roof for the interrogations. It's nice and out of the way.
2	box	Sergeant Tobyn escorts you to the palace roof.
2	action	end
